<div class="scp-image-block block-left" style="width:280px;"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/scp-4661/marines.JPG" style="width:280px;" class="enlarge" alt="marines.JPG" />
<div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:280px;">
<p>MTF Omega-18 &quot;Patriots&quot;.</p>
</div>
</div>
<p>Foundation forces have deployed across the city, and deployed mobile Scranton Reality Anchors in order to bring small staging areas back to baseline reality. The largest of these staging areas is in the MGM Grand Hotel and Casino, which is on the Las Vegas Strip — the epicenter of demonic activity.</p>
