<td>04:47</td>
<td>First convoy enters city limits through the Bruce Woodbury Beltway (I-215), meet light opposition from demonic entities, mostly armed with broken liquor bottles and blunt weapons.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>05:55</td>
<td>Convoy rolls onto Las Vegas Strip. Entities are packed into the streets, and hinder the convoy's progress by attempting to seduce the drivers. Two drivers are incapacitated.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>06: 24</td>
<td>Trucks enter the parking lot of the MGM Grand and begin clearing it of entities using holy water. Several entities are targeted before it is realized they are human prostitutes.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>7:02</td>
<td>MGM Grand Hotel is secured. A command and communications center are established in the building.</td>
</tr>
</table>



<div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:280px;"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/scp-4661/vegas2.png" style="width:280px;" class="enlarge" alt="vegas2.png" />
